<metadata><name>Galičica trail T-6</name><desc>T-6 is one of Galičica National Park's harder and longer hiking trails, with more climbing. It runs 11.5 km from near Oteshevo to the MTB-3 junction, climbing about 677 m and descending 76 m in the direction drawn, between 867 m and 1,524 m. https://galicica.finereli.com/trails/t-6/</desc><link href="https://galicica.finereli.com/"><text>galicica.finereli.com</text></link><copyright author="NP Galičica (trail lines), OpenStreetMap contributors (places, G-6)"><license>https://galicica.finereli.com/about/#license</license></copyright></metadata>
